I really appreciate this. I think you're absolutely right. My goal was to have just enough detail to where you knew the story, but didn't know all the details, so that you could fill them in yourself. I am much more a fan of shorter articles that don't include a lot of details. But I'm seeing that people obviously don't agree with me on this, and need this to be longer to be interested. Thank you for pointing this out.







